{"ref":"BDB, גְּרָר","hw":"גְּרָר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">גְּרָר</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.loc.</strong> south of Gaza, usually identif. with mod. <em>Umm Jerâr</em> Bd<sup>Pal. 159</sup> Guérin<sup>Judée ii. 257 ff.</sup>; but <em>Wady Jerūr</em> W. of <em>ʿAin Ḳadīs</em> according to Trumbull <sup>Kadesh Barnea 61 ff.</sup> cf. Guthe <sup>ZPV viii. 1885, 215</sup>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 20:2\" href=\"/Genesis.20.2\">Gn 20:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:6\" href=\"/Genesis.26.6\">26:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:20\" href=\"/Genesis.26.20\">20</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:26\" href=\"/Genesis.26.26\">26</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 14:12\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.14.12\">2 Ch 14:12</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 14:13\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.14.13\">13</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גְּרָ֫רָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 10:19\" href=\"/Genesis.10.19\">Gn 10:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:1\" href=\"/Genesis.26.1\">26:1</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">נַ֫חַל גְּרָר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:17\" href=\"/Genesis.26.17\">Gn 26:17</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּגָר בִּגְרָר</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 20:1\" href=\"/Genesis.20.1\">Gn 20:1</a>.","next":"BDB, גרשׂ","prev":"BDB, מְגֵרָה"}